course: dictionary
lesson: 304
title: Analogue: clocks with hands
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and the context tells you which one to use. The word analogue shows this. «On an analogue clock the short hand shows the hour, the long hand shows the minutes, and each number means 5 minutes.» The clock has hands and a dial, so analogue means a clock that shows the time with hands, not with digits.
explain: Look for clues in the sentence. The words «short hand», «long hand» and «each number means 5 minutes» tell you how an analogue clock works. Ask yourself: what would fit here? A clock with hands fits; a clock with digits does not.
explain: Analogue can also describe old-style machines that work with smooth changes, like a vinyl record or an old radio. Its opposite is digital, which uses numbers. Compare the two: an analogue clock has hands, and a digital clock shows numbers.
fact: An analogue clock or watch has hands that move around a dial instead of showing numbers.
fact: On an analogue clock, each number on the face stands for 5 minutes.
fact: Analogue describes old-style machines that work with smooth changes, not digital numbers.
fact: Analogue is the opposite of digital.
fact: As a noun, an analogue is something that is like something else and can be compared with it.
exercise: «On an analogue clock the long hand shows the minutes.» What does analogue mean here? | A clock that does not work | A very old clock made of stone | A clock that shows the time with digits | *A clock that shows the time with hands
exercise: Which word means the opposite of analogue? | *Digital | Dial | Smooth | Hands
exercise: On an analogue clock, each number on the face means how many minutes? | 15 minutes | *5 minutes | 1 minute | 60 minutes
test: Ellie says analogue can be a noun. Which meaning is the noun? | A watch with no hands at all | *Something that is like something else and can be compared with it | A clock with hands | A machine that uses digits
test: Why is the short hand important on an analogue clock? | It shows the minutes | *It shows the hour | It shows the seconds | It shows the date
exam: Which two words are opposites? | Analogue and clock | Hour and minute | *Analogue and digital | Hand and dial
